OL,3,GNEWSANew spinal board for emergency sea
OL,4,Apool rescues                           
OL,6,FA specialist spinal board has been     
OL,7,Finstalled to help rescuers dealing with
OL,8,Femergency rescues at an outdoor pool.  
OL,10,FThe equipment is designed to help      
OL,11,Frescuers deal with suspected spinal    
OL,12,Finjuries in the water at the Bathing   
OL,13,FPools in Guernsey.                     
OL,15,FThe board, funded by a partnership     
OL,16,Fbetween Guernsey Sports Commission,    
OL,17,FGuernsey Bluetits and the Medical      
OL,18,FSpecialist Group, can be used by       
OL,19,Frescuers to stabilise and remove       
OL,20,Fsomeone from the water while waiting   
OL,21,Ffor emergency services.                
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
