OL,3,GNEWSANew spinal board for emergency sea
OL,4,Apool rescues                           
OL,6,FAlan Jenner, outdoor and adventure     
OL,7,Fsports development officer at Guernsey 
OL,8,FSports Commission, said: "The board is 
OL,9,Fa valuable addition to safety provision
OL,10,Fat the Bathing Pools and an important  
OL,11,Ftraining tool for the wider community."
